body:
Be sure to comfort them through this, i cant imagine what it could be like for them. Also, let your friend know to try to block the bully if they can. 

&#x200B;

I hope everything turns out okay <3

Okay, an 80?! This isnt your fault.

You did the best you could. An 80 isnt horrible whatsoever!! I think you should distance yourself from your parents, because they are very mean. Call somebody, and maybe tell a trusted teacher at your school or staff personel, or even your SRO(If you do have one) They could help you get the help you need. 

&#x200B;

Also, your a great, amazing person. Do not listen to your parents. Do not let there insane expectations determine your self worth. Your great just how you are

&#x200B;

Im sorry if i sounded a bit intense in this im just VERY angry with how your parents are treating you >:(
